        "name": "Threads of Vibration",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Skarner's Attacks, Shattered Earth, Upheaval, and Impale, apply Quaking. At max stacks of Quaking, enemies take max Health magic damage over its duration.",
        "bodyHtml": "Skarner's Attacks, <span>Shattered Earth</span>, <span>Upheaval</span>, and <span>Impale</span>, apply <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Quaking</span> for 4s. At 3 stacks of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Quaking</span>, enemies take <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(500% ~ 900%) max Health magic damage</span> over its duration.",
