        "bodyHtml": "Skarner's tails lash forward, dealing <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(150/250/350 + (100% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Suppressing</span> the first 3 champions he hits for 1.5s. Those hit are dragged along by Skarner for the duration of this Ability.<br /><br />If Skarner hits at least one champion he gains <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">40% Move Speed</span> for 1.5 seconds.<br /><br />If <span>Shattered Earth</span> is active, Skarner will cast <span>Upheaval</span> first.",
